<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Cancellation & Refund Policy | NetZeroMart</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/netZeroStickerIcon.png" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased font-sans flex flex-col min-h-screen">
    <%- include('../components/header.ejs') %>

    <main class="flex-grow max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-950">Cancellation and Refund Policy</h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
        </div>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">1. Digital Catalogue Service Nature</h2>
          <p>
            NetZeroMart provides digital listing and catalogue exposure services for sustainable manufacturers and suppliers. Upon verified payment for your chosen annual subscription plan, catalogue visibility and monthly upload quotas are activated for 365 days.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">2. Cancellation Policy</h2>
          <p>
            Because all subscriptions are billed annually without recurring auto-debits, you are never locked into an ongoing automatic charge. If you choose not to renew, simply let your plan expire. Your products and articles will be temporarily hidden from the public catalogue without any penalty or recurring deduction.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">3. Refund Policy</h2>
          <p>
            Due to the annual nature of digital directory services and immediate server allocation, subscription fees are generally non-refundable once verified and activated by our accounts team. In cases of duplicate transfers or banking discrepancies, please reach out to our team at <a href="mailto:netzeromart@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">netzeromart@gmail.com</a> within 7 days with your UTR transaction reference for an immediate investigation and resolution.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('../components/footer.ejs') %>
  </body>
</html>
